            <note corresp="#d96-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d96-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Central Intelligence Agency, Office of the Director of Central
                    Intelligence, Job 80M00165A, Box 23, Folder 3: 468. No classification marking.
                    The meeting ended at 11:04 a.m.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d96-f2" n="2" xml:id="d96-f2-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d95-f2">footnote 2, Document 95.</ref>
                </p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d96-f3" n="3" xml:id="d96-f3-content">
                <p> Carter sent the treaties to the Senate for ratification on September 16. For the
                    text of Carter’s letter of transmittal to the Senate, see the Department of
                    State <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, October 17, 1977, p. 486.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
